   1: // Fly connections memory v1: one neural condition (all-legal scoring, pulse-gated replay, local-rate update).
   2: // Computational endpoint model only: raw fixed MBON05 endpoint score, actual local DAN-rate gain rule, no
   3: // biological clock, no receptor kinetics, no transmitter identity, not a calibrated value. The teacher verifies
   4: // and schedules; the fly receives only unchanged eyes stimulation plus the scheduled PAM07 current.
